# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# espeak-ng build workspaces
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The setup-* scripts configure CMake inside the submodule. Their build trees
# are disposable — the staged artifacts under Source/ThirdParty/ are what the
# plugin actually consumes, and those ARE tracked (see README → Licensing for
# why the corresponding source submodule must stay alongside them).
EspeakNG/vendor/build-*/
EspeakNG/vendor/build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / editor / per-developer tool state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.iml
*.iws

# Claude Code per-developer permission grants — machine-specific local paths,
# intentionally not shared.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
